      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Bloodfalls [zone=1286]\n**Who:**\n- Diabo Va Atraeth [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a feral vampire - female [npc=57176]\n- a feral vampire - male [npc=57109]\n- a forgotten vampire - female [npc=57177]\n- a forgotten vampire - male [npc=57110]\n- a lost vampire [npc=57113]\n- a nameless vampire [npc=57114]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of Bloodfalls (10 Points) [quest=10587]\n**Era:** | !Terror of Luclin\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Oct 21 02:19:46 2021\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Terror of Luclin Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this quest by speaking to Diabo Va Atraeth in Bloodfalls at -65, -716, -37 in the southeast corner of the zone. This NPC is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Diabo Va Atraeth'\nDiabo Va Atraeth says, 'Lumanes.' He presses his lower hands to his chest. 'Diabo Va Atraeth. It is good to meet you. We have a concern. Uh...' He pauses, searching for the words. 'Phalius t'thox [vaunaer].'\nYou say, 'What do you mean by 'phalius t'thox vaunaer'?'\nDiabo Va Atraeth says, 'By, um, these rivers. Sickness to the beings of blood, tuis invarnausar datiar, they are ill from blood rivers. Without proper drink, their mind tavuel, hurts, suffers greatly. Mind now void. Will you [spare their hearts] by giving tekar, um, death?'\nYou say, 'I will spare their hearts and give them a proper death.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Controlling the Feral Population'.\nDiabo Va Atraeth says, 'Vis, sivuela. Our thanks, and ishta, respect.'\n\n---\n\n1\\. Kill 10 Feral Vampires 0/10 Bloodfalls\n> **Quest Text:** An Akhevan going by Diabo Va Atraeth has indicated concern for some enemy combatants. Fearing that they may no longer be present in mind, he suggest clearing them out to give them proper rest.\nThis step updates on killing a lost vampire, a nameless vampire, a forgotten vampire, and a feral vampire.\n2\\. Inform Diabo Va Atraeth that it is done 0/1 Bloodfalls\nTo complete step 2 and the quest, just hail Diabo Va Atraeth\nThe vampires' numbers are thinned thanks to your help. Wait, what?\nDiabo Va Atraeth calls out to the nearby shadow personnel, face neutral. 'Ans sivuela asir tekarun ans ka rulourim dutenuseum.' He turns towards Thorque and replies. 'You have spared them much pain, much hunger. Our thanks. Vyanemis.'\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nMoney\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
