      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Bloodfalls [zone=1286]\n**Who:**\n- Sir Godfrey Barantyn [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a war shade [npc=57128]\n- an attacking shade [npc=57178]\n- an invading shade - Bloodfalls [npc=57133]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of Bloodfalls (10 Points) [quest=10587]\n**Era:** | !Terror of Luclin\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Oct 21 02:30:20 2021\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Terror of Luclin Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nThis quest can be obtained by speaking to Sir Godfrey Barantyn in Bloodfalls. He can be found in the northeast corner of the zone at 607, -355, 6. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Sir Godfrey Barantyn'\nSir Godfrey Barantyn says, 'Aha, reinforcements have arrived! You are most welcome to our little slice of Blood, friend. Most welcome.' He tugs at his tunic to straighten and tidy up his appearance. 'I am Godfrey Barantyn - Sir Godfrey Barantyn, a baronet of Dreadspire, and well, I just [arrived] here not long ago, myself.'\nYou say, 'You had just arrived, sir?'\nSir Godfrey Barantyn says, 'Well, that's the problem. I've lost track of the time, you see. Well, it's no matter; you're here now! I have a couple assignments here if you're up for them: Would you prefer to collect the [horns] of our enemies, or extinguish a few [shades]?'\nYou say, 'I can take down some shades.'\n[Sir Godfrey Barantyn says, 'That's the spirit. Spirit, get it?' He flashes a fangy smile. 'You can find them to the south with the other invaders. Please [rid] us of them.'\nYou say, 'I'll be happy to rid you all of them.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Throwing Shade'.\nSir Godfrey Barantyn says, 'Very good! Let us know when the deed is done.'\n\n---\n\n1\\. Kill 8 Shades 0/8 Bloodfalls\n> **Quest Text:** Sir Godfrey Barantyn, a baronet of Dreadspire, has requested assistance to cull the invaders to his master's demiplane. Rid the Bloodfalls of the shades and report back to him.\nUpdates from an invading shade, an attacking shade, and a war shade.\n2\\. Tell Sir Godfrey Barantyn the deed is done 0/1 Bloodfalls\nYou say, 'Hail, Sir Godfrey Barantyn'\nYour task 'Throwing Shade' has been updated.\nThe Bloodfalls survive another day as the shades are silenced.\nSir Godfrey Barantyn says, 'I could hear their shrieks from here. Good job, my friend.'\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nMoney for your level |\\\n**Submitted by:** Gidono |\\\nRewards: |\\\n|\\",
