      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Bloodfalls [zone=1286]\n**Who:**\n- Frank [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Wineskin of Blood [item=142713]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Basilica of Adumbration (10 Points) [quest=10586]\n**Era:** | !Terror of Luclin\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Oct 21 16:44:03 2021\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Terror of Luclin Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this quest from Frank in Bloodfalls. He can be found at the ruins in the northeast corner of the zone. He is on the Find tool (Ctrl+F).\nYou say, 'Hail, Frank'\nFrank says, 'Oh, well met. Are you here to [assist] Mayong Mistmoore's forces?'\nYou say, 'I am here to assist.'\nFrank says, 'It's good to meet you then. I am Frankford Fletch, but you can call me Frank. I am afraid I'm not much of a fighter, even in undeath, but my organizational skills are well regarded. As such, I'm here to help gather support for Mr. Mistmoore and do [supporty] things, like bringing back his ferally hungry [personnel].'\nYou say, 'Supporty?'\nFrank says, 'In most cases, it would be working on a tax audit for one of the aristocracy. I do love myself a pile of paperwork and numbers.'\nYou say, 'Would you like help bringing back the personnel?'\nFrank says, 'If it's not too much to ask, we would appreciate the [help]. All you would need to do is bring some fresh blood - by way of our wineskins - around to those affected and let them get their fill. If they are not too far gone, they should recover their senses and make their way back towards Dreadspire. If they are beyond saving, however, do mind your neck.'\nYou say, 'I can help.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'You're Not Yourself When You're Hungry'.\nFrank says, 'Thank you. Please let me know when you're ready for the [wineskin] of blood. Also, if you misplace it, let me know and I'll be happy to replace it.'\n\n---\n\n1\\. Pick up a wineskin of blood from Frank 0/1 Bloodfalls\n> **Quest Text:** Frank Fletch is helping coordinate the response for getting the feral vampires the help they need to recover. Take the fresh blood wineskin around to various hot spots, and offer its contens to some of the vampires present to see if they can recover their senses enough to make it back to the safety of the inner-demiplane.\nSay \"I need a wineskin of blood\" to get the wineskin from Frank.\nFrank says, 'Here you go, pre-packaged for ease of access.'\nYou receive a Wineskin of Blood [item=142713].\n2\\. Explore the northwest ruins, looking for vampires 0/1 Bloodfalls\nThis updates around /waypoint +568, +683.\n3\\. Offer some blood to 3 vampires 0/3 Bloodfalls\nRight-click the wineskin on a vampire. If it succeeds (which it does not always), they stop attacking:\nAfter a hungry swig of the wineskin, the vampire's dilated pupils constrict as sanity is regained. Giving thanks, they start off towards the portal.\n4\\. Explore the north central ruins, looking for vampires 0/1 Bloodfalls\nThis updates in the ruins at /waypoint +526, +163.\n5\\. Offer some blood to 3 vampires 0/3 Bloodfalls\n6\\. Explore the northeast subterranean cave, looking for vampires 0/1 Bloodfalls\nThis updates in the cave at /waypoint +482, -653, -72.\n7\\. Offer some blood to 4 vampires 0/4 Bloodfalls\n8\\. Return the wineskin of blood to Frank 0/1 Bloodfalls\nWhile not everyone could be saved from the madness, you've done a great service to the vampires.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n354 platinum 1 gold 6 silver 7 copper\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
