[bring] a number of them back to me to show as proof of your battles, I can reward you in kind.'\nYou say, 'I can bring them back.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'By the Horns'.\nSir Godfrey Barantyn says, 'I shall see you very soon then! Thank you, kind adventurer.'\n\n---\n\n1\\. Loot 4 Akheva Horns from Akheva invaders 0/4 Bloodfalls\n> **Quest Test:** Sir Godfrey Baratyn, a baronet of Dreadspire, has requested assistance to cull the invaders to his master's demiplane. To show proof of the deed, he has requested a handful of horns from the Shadow Mistress' minions.\n2\\. Loot 2 Servant Horns from Servants of Shadow 0/2 Bloodfalls\na servant of shadow, a laborer of shadow, and an attendant of shadow can drop the Servant Horn.\n3\\. Return 4 Akheva Horns to Sir Godfrey Barantyn 0/4 Bloodfalls\nUpon hand-in of Akhevan Horns:\nSir Godfrey Barantyn says, 'Akhevan horns! A wonderful specimen!'\n4\\. Return 2 Servant Horns to Sir Godfrey Barantyn 0/2 Bloodfalls\nUpon hand-in of Servant Horns:\nSir Godfrey Barantyn says 'These horns are perfect, thank you!'\nYour task 'By the Horns' has been updated.\nSatisfied with the thinning of the herd, Sir Godfrey throws the horns into a box beside him, and offers you a small reward for your troubles.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nMoney for your level\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
