      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Bloodfalls [zone=1286]\n**Who:**\n- Sorcha, Governess of Serenity [ _Raids and Mission_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 113\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Expedition\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 05:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- Bloodfalls - Close the Gate - Group [zone=1291]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Centien Detraias [npc=57370]\n- Kratakel, Lord Misery [npc=57374]\n- Pli Liako - Close the Gate [npc=57368]\n- Xin Thall Tavuel [npc=57369]\n- a bloodied chest [npc=57375]\n- a darkwing bat [npc=57363]\n- a deadly shade [npc=57372]\n- a grinning gargoyle - Close the Gate [npc=57367]\n- a pool of shadow [npc=57364]\n- a shade - Close the Gate [npc=57371]\n- a shade beetle [npc=57362]\n- a shadowstone grabber [npc=57366]\n- a waning phantom [npc=57373]\n- clotted strands [npc=57365]\n**Era:** | !Terror of Luclin\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Nov 28 23:04:26 2021\nModified: Sun Mar 31 02:50:49 2024 | | **Terror of Luclin Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n**Prerequisite Quests** You'll need to complete Oubliette of Light Group Mission [quest=10515] in order to get this mission.\nYou can get this group mission from Sorcha, Governess of Serenity in Bloodfalls. She is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Sorcha, Governess of Serenity'\nSorcha, Governess of Serenity says, 'Ah, a (Your Race). Well, why are you here? Have you come with some small [group], or are you here with some [larger] force?'\nYou say, 'group'\nSorcha, Governess of Serenity says, 'The gate remains open, but only a few of the Shadow creatures have come through. Their blood is of no interest to the rabble that live here, so motivating them isn't likely. In fact, they will be more interested in your blood than anything else. You will have to drive the Shadows back to allow my consanguinists to close the gate. If too much time passes, then we will need a much larger force to deal with them. You need to be [ready] quickly or the situation will grow worse.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Close the Gate'.\nYou say, 'ready'\nSorcha, Governess of Serenity says, 'Well then, let's get started.'\n\n---\n\n> When Mayong was forced to open a portal to the demiplane of Blood to escape the Plane of Shadow, Luclin used her power to keep that gate open. Now she drains the power from the demiplane. For what purpose is unknown, since she keeps her secrets. While Mayong is not an ally of the people of Norrath, it seems unwise to allow Luclin to steal all of the power he has accumulated over the years for her own purposes. Help the vampires by driving out the forces of shadow long enough for them to perform a blood ritual and close the gate.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n177 platinum 8 silver 3 copper\nYou gain experience!\n45 Scarlet Marks\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- Scarlet Mark [item=141752]",
