      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Bloodfalls [zone=1286]\n**Who:**\n- Frank [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:30:00\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Abe Blinkin [npc=57129]\n- Beaumont [npc=57179]\n- Hans Velsing [npc=57135]\n- Lasna Cheroon [npc=57192]\n- Lukan [npc=57181]\n- Tiffy Winters [npc=57140]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Bloodfalls (10 Points) [quest=10588]\n**Era:** | !Terror of Luclin\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Dec 18 21:35:28 2021\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Terror of Luclin Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nPrerequisite: You're Not Yourself When You're Hungry [quest=10505].\nYou say, 'Hail, Frank'\nFrank says, 'On the edges of reality are the edges of our sanity. Thank you, again, for bringing back who you could. Now that I believe we can [trust] you, there's something else we could use your help on.'\nYou say, 'You can trust me.'\nFrank says, 'Thank you for the assurance, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. We're having a slight problem in that we're being... Um, how do I put this? We're being flanked by vampire [hunters] while we're also juggling the war to the south.'\nYou say, 'Vampire hunters?'\nFrank says, 'Well, to be honest, while you would think that we would be quite powerful and could take them out easily, I wasn't exactly strong when I was alive, so supercharging my mediocrity with vampire abilities is, well... you get the idea. Adventurers, however? You'll be fine.' He gives a reassuring smile. 'The source you'll want to contact for details on the local hunters is Lasna Cheroon, who has a stakeout location to the southwest and down one level. [Talk to her] and she can share the latest information.'\nYou say, 'I'll talk to Lasna.'\nFrank says, 'Thank you. We really do appreciate it.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Who Hunts the Hunters'.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Seek out Lasna Cheroon for information regarding the hunters 0/1 Bloodfalls\nLasna Cheroon [npc=57192] is located in the southwest part of the zone. She's on Find (Ctrl+F).\n2\\. Find, confront and kill Abe Blinkin 0/1 Bloodfalls\nYou say, 'Hail, Abe Blinkin'\nAbe Blinkin says, 'There is no greater danger, adventurer. I shall kill them all!'\n3\\. Find, confront and kill Tiffy Winters 0/1 Bloodfalls\nYou say, 'Hail, Tiffy Winters'\nTiffy Winters gently files her nails. 'Can you [leave]? I have things I need to be doing.'\nYou say, 'I was just about to ask if you could leave.'\nTiffy Winters says, 'I can't leave. Believe me, I want to. I'd rather be shopping in Felwithe's [fashion] district. If I don't take care of these vamps, they're going to take over.'\nYou say, 'Yes, please go shopping for fashion rather than spending time looking for vampires.'\nTiffy Winters says, 'Is that really the way you want to die? Insulting my hobbies?'\n4\\. Gather additional intel from Lasna Cheroon 0/1 Bloodfalls\nYou say, 'Hail, Lasna Cheroon'\nLasna Cheroon says, 'You did well, mortal. Better than I would have thought. While you were gone, I received some intel on the locations of a couple more targets. First, west of the massive falls to the north I'm told a lycan hunter lies in wait. The next target after that is a hunter hiding out in one of the northwestern bat caves.'\n5\\. Find, confront and kill Lukan 0/1 Bloodfalls\n6\\. Find, confront and kill Beaumont 0/1 Bloodfalls\nYou say, 'Hail, Beaumont'\nYou say, 'I'm here on behalf of the vampires.'\nBeaumont says, 'Are you now? Well, well. That's quite a twist. Now you're going to tell me that you're here to [fight] rather than talk, yes?'\nYou say, 'Yes, indeed. Not only to fight, but to kill you.'\n7\\. Update Lasna Cheroon and check for intel on the final target 0/1 Bloodfalls\nYou say, 'Hail, Lasna Cheroon'\nLasna Cheroon says, 'Lovely, I can still smell the lycanthropic blood on you.' She snarls briefly in disgust. 'That said, you've done well to rid us of the hunters. My sources say there's one more that is about to strike, looking to strike at the central ruins. If it's who I think it is, he's a veteran of vampire hunting, so mind yourself.'\n8\\. Find, confront and kill Hans Velsing 0/1 Bloodfalls\nYou say, 'Hail, Hans Velsing'\nHans Velsing says, 'You claim to know the bigger picture, but I cannot stand idly by when a fellow living being defends the most dangerous vampires of our time. Prepare yourself.'\n9\\. Inform Lasna Cheroon that the hunters are defeated 0/1 Bloodfalls\nYou say, 'Hail, Lasna Cheroon'\nLasna Cheroon says, 'Finally, that is a relief. That's one less thing to worry about. I recommend moving with haste to update Frank.' Under her breath, she adds, 'If only because you're making me hungry and I need to focus.'\n10\\. Update Frank that the hunters are defeated 0/1 Bloodfalls\nYou say, 'Hail, Frank'\nFrank says, 'That is a relief. I know it may not seem like much, especially from a vampire, but you did the right thing and we really appreciate it.'\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n354 platinum, 1 gold, 6 silver, 7 copper\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
